flowchart TD
  Host[宿主设置展示／命令] --> Resolver[Core：路线解析与当前配置复核]
  Host --> Forms[Core：通用设置描述符]
  Module[平台或共享模型模块] --> Registry[有作用域的能力注册表]
  Registry --> Catalog[冻结目录与模块租约]
  Catalog --> Forms
  Catalog --> Provider[设置提供者：纯校验与参数组装]
  Catalog --> Adapter[执行适配器：prepare／stream／replay]
  Resolver --> Catalog
  Resolver --> Store[AgentModelSettingsStore]
  Store --> SQL[Data：共享业务库中的当前配置]
  Resolver --> Frozen[不可变 AgentModelRoute]
  Frozen --> Journal[会话日志中的持久执行计划]
  Journal --> Kernel[执行内核与强制授权边界]
  Kernel --> Adapter
